    "He has just been",
    "buried. I shall",
    "never forget these",
    "terrible three days;",
    "the hideous suspense",
    "of the ride on;",
    "the dull, inert",
    "sorrow, during",
    "which I felt as",
    "if I had been",
    "stunned, or as if",
